From ec54b36ea9b5e546e6593e308c9554387df437af Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Felucca dev <dev@example.invalid>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 06:30:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] MENU > CONTROL > SEQ SWITCH: NOW or at the END of the
 sequence playing

A sequence chosen while the music plays can wait for the last step of the one
playing (pb_request / pb_due in patbank.c, seq_poll in the main loop). The
waiting one shows on SEQ > SEQUENCE and blinks on its key. Editor setting id 25
(append-only); ui_prefs2 bit 4.
